= Otto Hörsing's resignation 

With the military having gained a notable influence in the Reichsbanner, Otto Hörsing has been disillusioned with the SPD. Thus he has resigned.

In his stead is Karl Holtermann, confounder, and now chairman of the Reichsbanner. Despite his long expertise in the Reichsbanner, many of it's members are now discouraged after seeing their leader resign. We assume now it will be harder to militarize the Reichsbanner from now on.


